<script setup lang="ts">import { Head,Link } from '@inertiajs/vue3';import { Plus } from '@lucide/vue';import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button';defineProps<{sales:{data:any[]};canCreate:boolean}>();const money=(v:number)=>new Intl.NumberFormat('es-CO',{style:'currency',currency:'COP',maximumFractionDigits:0}).format(v||0);</script><template><Head title="Ventas"/><main class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-5 p-4 md:p-6"><header class="flex justify-between"><div><h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Ventas</h1><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Contado, crédito y entregas de pedidos.</p></div><Button v-if="canCreate" as-child><Link href="/sales/create"><Plus/> Nueva venta</Link></Button></header><section class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border bg-card"><table class="w-full text-sm"><thead class="border-b bg-muted/40 text-left"><tr><th class="px-4 py-3">Documento</th><th class="px-4 py-3">Cliente</th><th class="px-4 py-3">Fecha</th><th class="px-4 py-3">Estado</th><th class="px-4 py-3">Total / saldo</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y"><tr v-for="sale in sales.data" :key="sale.id"><td class="px-4 py-3"><Link :href="`/sales/${sale.id}`" class="font-medium text-amber-700 hover:underline">{{sale.document_number}}</Link></td><td class="px-4 py-3">{{sale.customer}}</td><td class="px-4 py-3">{{sale.sold_at}}</td><td class="px-4 py-3">{{sale.status_label}}</td><td class="px-4 py-3">{{money(sale.total)}} / {{money(sale.balance_amount)}}</td></tr></tbody></table></section></main></template>
